{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-al-thuraya-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"al-thuraya-island-ajmal-makan-city-al-hamriya","about":"AJMAL MAKAN Real Estate Development, a leader in urban and mixed-use developments, has launched its latest project, Al Thuraya Island in Sharjah. Strategically located near key landmarks in Sharjah and Dubai, Al Thuraya Island offers an exclusive beach area spanning 564,000 SQFT and expansive green spaces covering over 1.3 million SQFT. The Al Thuraya Island project features luxury villas and palaces, including the 5BR Sea Breeze Villa, 6 BR Serene Villa, 6BR Azura Villa, 8 BR Grandeur Villa, and 8BR Majestic Villa, providing residents with unparalleled opulence and comfort.Situated on the Sharjah waterfront within AJMAL MAKAN city, Al Thuraya Island by Ajmal Makan enhances the allure of waterfront living. The island combines sustainability, distinctive architectural styles, modern furnishings, and state-of-the-art amenities. It epitomizes the concept of an advanced integrated city where residents enjoy luxury, comfort, and a healthy lifestyle amid natural beauty and pristine beaches. The Althuraya Island Location offers a unique living experience within a vibrant community, making it an ideal Al Thuraya Island investment.","price":3875000,"title":"Al Thuraya Island","bitrix":{"id":576,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Al Thuraya Island","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Al Thuraya Island","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Ajmal Makan","project_location":"Al Hamriya"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Al_Thuraya_Island_Villas_at_Ajmal_Makan_City_Sharjah_130745b7ff.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Al_Thuraya_Island_Villas_at_Ajmal_Makan_City_Sharjah_130745b7ff.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.499182,"lng":55.537808},"country":"sharjah","i